      "message": "fix(winemetal): create a `MTLCompileOptions` for `newLibraryWithSource`\n\nAnd set `languageVersion` to 3.1\nPer doc:\n> By default, Metal uses the most recent language version.\nBut unfortunately this isn't the case, without this patch a shader uses icb with mesh pipeline will be failed to compile.\n\nSigned-off-by: Feifan He <feifan@codeweavers.com>",
